  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents a highlight annotation in a PDF document.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a highlight annotation in a PDF document.</para>
      <para>If the highlight color is not explicitly set using <c>#setColor(Color)</c>,
            the default color is yellow.</para>
      <para>
        <format type="text/html">
          <a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/pdf/component/HighlightAnnotation" title="Reference documentation">Java documentation for <code>android.graphics.pdf.component.HighlightAnnotation</code>.</a>
